<title>USA: Bank of N.Y. picked as fiscal agent for Ore..</title>
<headline>Bank of N.Y. picked as fiscal agent for Ore..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co Inc said Tuesday it was selected as fiscal agent for the general obligation bonds of the state of Oregon, issued by the Oregon state treasury.</p>
<p>The company said it will provide paying agent, registrar, transfer and tender agent services to holders of bearer, fully registered and book-entry securities issued by the state.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the conversion to be completed by July 14.</p>
